# Glanne Valley Railway | GameWave

Upload the ZIP itself. The package has index.html at its root. The HTML can also be opened directly in a WebGL browser. The 3D map and runtime are bundled locally.

Tap and hold **Power**. Release to coast. Tap **Brake** to stop at each platform. Continue from Viaduct Halt to the terminus. The result screen offers a return service.

The SDK receives gameStart when the player first powers a service and gameOver on terminal arrival or a deliberate restart of an active service. An intermediate station does not end the round. The browser checkpoint uses only glanne-valley-web-v1. The cloud stores the best outbound and return reports, station stamps, and optional cosmetic reward flags. Confirmed like and direct comment callbacks grant separate cosmetic rewards once per saved profile.

The original route, geometry, and rolling stock are derived from Glanne Valley by dreamer2664. See CREDITS.md and LICENSE. Three.js and pako notices are embedded in the HTML.

